    "description": "Order a famous made-from-scratch Casey\u2019s pizza, for carryout or delivery, with the all-new Casey's app. Browse our menu, see the best deals, customize your pizza, and place an order fast! And when it's time to order again on Friday, you can reorder your favorites with just a few taps.\r\n\r\nDownload the Casey's app today \u2013 and create an account to join Casey\u2019s Rewards \u2013 so you can earn points, save your favorite order, set a default credit card, and search for nearby gas prices.",
